  <h1>Bulk E-Waste Pickup in Kochi</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Bulk pickup means anything that does not fit into a routine single-visit doorstep collection: 30 laptops from an office IT refresh, a full apartment cleanout, a school store-room clearance, a hospital retiring old imaging workstations. This page covers what qualifies as bulk, how scheduling differs from routine pickup, and what documentation is available for bulk jobs.
  </p>

